जीवभूतां महाबाहो ययेदं धार्यते जगत् ॥ ५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2128,\"bb\":1886,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1886/\",\"body_value\":\"apareyam itas tv anyāṁ
prakṛtiṁ viddhi me parām
jīva-bhūtāṁ mahā-bāho
yayedaṁ dhāryate jagat\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2129,\"bb\":1887,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1887/\",\"shadow_value\":\"aparā – inferior; iyam – this; itaḥ – besides this; tu – but; anyām – another; prakṛtim – energy; viddhi – just try to understand; me – My; parām – superior; jīva-bhūtām – comprising the living entities; mahā-bāho – O mighty-armed one; yayā – by whom; idam – this; dhāryate – is utilized or exploited; jagat – the material world.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"aparā\",\"translation\":\"inferior\"},{\"word\":\"iyam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"itaḥ\",\"translation\":\"besides this\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"but\"},{\"word\":\"anyām\",\"translation\":\"another\"},{\"word\":\"prakṛtim\",\"translation\":\"energy\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"just try to understand\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"My\"},{\"word\":\"parām\",\"translation\":\"superior\"},{\"word\":\"jīva-bhūtām\",\"translation\":\"comprising the living entities\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-bāho\",\"translation\":\"O mighty-armed one\"},{\"word\":\"yayā\",\"translation\":\"by whom\"},{\"word\":\"idam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"dhāryate\",\"translation\":\"is utilized or exploited\"},{\"word\":\"jagat\",\"translation\":\"the material world\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2130,\"bb\":1888,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1888/\",\"body_value\":\"Besides these, O mighty-armed Arjuna, there is another, superior energy of Mine, which comprises the living entities who are exploiting the resources of this material, inferior nature.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2131,\"bb\":1889,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1889/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2132,\"bb\":1890,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1890/\",\"body_value\":\"aparimitā dhruvās tanu-bhṛto yadi sarva-gatās
tarhi na śāsyateti niyamo dhruva netarathā
ajani ca yan-mayaṁ tad avimucya niyantṛ bhavet
samam anujānatāṁ yad amataṁ mata-duṣṭatayā\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2133,\"bb\":1891,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1891/\",\"body_value\":\"“O Supreme Eternal! If the embodied living entities were eternal and all-pervading like You, then they would not be under Your control. But if the living entities are accepted as minute energies of Your Lordship, then they are at once subject to Your supreme control. Therefore real liberation entails surrender by the living entities to Your control, and that surrender will make them happy. In that constitutional position only can they be controllers. Therefore, men with limited knowledge who advocate the monistic theory that God and the living entities are equal in all respects are actually guided by a faulty and polluted opinion.”\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2134,\"bb\":1892,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/5/b1892/\",\"body_value\":\"$26\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 7.5\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 7.5\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n31:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n27:[\"$\",\"div\",null